      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>An improved version of the sweeper, outfitted with spinning saw blades at the end of each arm.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 22, touch 12, flat-footed 19 (+3 Dex, +10 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 95 [140] (10d10+40)</p><p>Fort +8, Ref +9, Will +9</p><p>Defensive Abilities hardness 5, resilient; Immune Construct traits</p><p>Resist Ice 10, Water 10</p><p>Weakness Critical hits and Lightning</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Buzz Saws +18 (2d12+8)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Boosted Charge, Buzzsaw Blitz</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 26, Dex 16, Con -, Int 12, Wis 16, Cha 4</p><p>Base Atk +10; CMB +19; CMD 32</p><p>Feats Cleave, Great Fortitude, Power Attack, Toughness, Weapon Focus (Buzz Saw)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +12, Perception +14, Sense Motive +14</p><p>Languages Common</p><p><strong>GM note:</strong> Understands Common but cannot speak.</p>"
